WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:03.167
-Hey, guys, it is time
for a "News Smash."

00:00:03.167 --> 00:00:08.100
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:08.100 --> 00:00:10.133
First up,
it's St. Patrick's Day.

00:00:10.133 --> 00:00:12.367
The big parade might not be
happening this year.

00:00:12.367 --> 00:00:14.534
But that doesn't mean
you can't celebrate the Irish

00:00:14.534 --> 00:00:16.234
with some corned beef
and cabbage

00:00:16.234 --> 00:00:18.167
that you bought
using the money from...

00:00:18.167 --> 00:00:19.601
your stimulus check.

00:00:19.601 --> 00:00:22.300
Biden says 100 million people
will receive $1,400

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:24.133
or more in the next 10 days.

00:00:24.133 --> 00:00:27.133
Though I have a feeling a lot of
them will blow their money on...

00:00:27.133 --> 00:00:28.234
March Madness.

00:00:28.234 --> 00:00:30.033
People are making bets
left and right.

00:00:30.033 --> 00:00:32.501
Who will make it to
the Sweet 16, the Final Four?

00:00:32.501 --> 00:00:33.801
Who will go all the way?

00:00:33.801 --> 00:00:36.300
Well, if you want to go all the
way why not try...

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:37.567
Tinder?

00:00:37.567 --> 00:00:39.400
The app is in the news
because they're mailing

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:41.701
free COVID tests to people,
so they can be safe

00:00:41.701 --> 00:00:43.133
before going on dates.

00:00:43.133 --> 00:00:45.300
Some users like the idea,
others think it's weird,

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:47.767
but one idea
everyone can get behind?

00:00:47.767 --> 00:00:49.334
Stimulus checks.

00:00:49.334 --> 00:00:51.067
Gimme that stim-y.

00:00:51.067 --> 00:00:52.834
That moolah.
That cold, hard cash.

00:00:52.834 --> 00:00:54.834
That cheddar. That paper.
That lettuce.

00:00:54.834 --> 00:00:56.567
That...green.

00:00:56.567 --> 00:00:58.634
Green beer. Green hair.
Green clothes.

00:00:58.634 --> 00:01:00.601
Some people pinch you if you're
not wearing green.

00:01:00.601 --> 00:01:02.501
And they're the kind of people
you should avoid on...

00:01:02.501 --> 00:01:03.968
Tinder.

00:01:03.968 --> 00:01:06.434
You can get tested before a big
date, and let's be honest,

00:01:06.434 --> 00:01:09.367
you should probably get
"tested" after, too.

00:01:09.367 --> 00:01:12.334
Though I've got to say, dating
right now seems like complete...

00:01:12.334 --> 00:01:15.300
madness -- 68 teams
vying for the top spot.

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:17.033
A bunch of college kids
going at it,

00:01:17.033 --> 00:01:18.968
which is also a great way
to describe...

00:01:18.968 --> 00:01:20.934
Tinder.

00:01:20.934 --> 00:01:22.367
In conclusion...

00:01:22.367 --> 00:01:23.834
you're in luck.

00:01:23.834 --> 00:01:25.334
Good luck out there.

00:01:25.334 --> 00:01:26.901
You might get lucky.

00:01:26.901 --> 00:01:28.534
[ Irish accent ]
It's the luck o' the Irish.

00:01:28.534 --> 00:01:30.968
This has been a "News Smash."

